    <string name="oem_battery_title">Manufacturer battery saver</string>
    <string name="oem_battery_xiaomi">Xiaomi may stop the app completely – then no alerts arrive. Turn on “Autostart” and set Battery saver to “No restrictions”.</string>
    <string name="oem_battery_samsung">Samsung may put the app to deep sleep – then no alerts arrive. Under Battery › Background usage limits, add it to “Never sleeping apps”.</string>
    <string name="oem_battery_huawei">Huawei/Honor may stop the app – then no alerts arrive. Under Battery › App launch, choose “Manage manually” and allow all options.</string>
    <string name="oem_battery_oneplus">OnePlus may stop the app – then no alerts arrive. Allow “Auto-launch” and, under Battery usage, background activity.</string>
    <string name="oem_battery_oppo">Oppo/Realme may stop the app – then no alerts arrive. Allow “Auto launch” and, under Battery usage, background activity.</string>
    <string name="oem_battery_vivo">Vivo may stop the app – then no alerts arrive. Allow “Autostart” and, under Battery, high background power use.</string>
